      "message": "I had to revert the SkSTArray version for several reasons. After fixing those (name conflicts with Layer, fuzzer issues, Android IWYU failures)... I also realized we had SkTLList. It\u0027s got the same nice memory properties as SkDeque (chunked allocation, pre-allocates a block, never moves elements), but it\u0027s also templated so we don\u0027t need the manual casting and placement new/delete. Enjoy.",
